      "ref": "TMM/Part23/3/3/4~2",
      "quote": "references to Internet website/s where trade mark is used, together with analytic figures which assist in determining the number of visitors to the website from Australia since the date of first use (if possible, broken down periodically) download figures for any relevant app used by the applicant that features the trade mark being used for the relevant goods and services third party social media and/or SEO reports"
